{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":34443,"name":"Jorropo","username":"Jorropo","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/gov.uniswap.org/jorropo/{size}/2769_2.png","created_at":"2021-07-24T18:47:36.482Z","cooked":"\u003ch1\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-34443-tldr-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-34443-tldr-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eTL;DR\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe have people creating uncensored builds of the UI which are just following Uniswap Labs ones but without the block list.\u003cbr\u003e\nLet’s use this for \u003ccode\u003euniswap.eth\u003c/code\u003e instead of \u003ccode\u003eapp.uniswap.org\u003c/code\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\nTo do so create a multisig validating uncensored builds of uniswap made by peoples like \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/micah\"\u003e@Micah\u003c/a\u003e and point \u003ccode\u003euniswap.eth\u003c/code\u003e to an ENS that this multisig control.\u003cbr\u003e\nThen when a new version is made, someone publish it, the multisig review it, and it if it’s fine then the multisig approve the change updating \u003ccode\u003euniswap.eth\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch1\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-34443-details-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-34443-details-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDetails\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRecently uniswap labs updated the UI to stop supporting lots of tokens, some obviously makes sense like Tether Gold which is bugged and lock liquidity forever.\u003cbr\u003e\nBut most tokens are just what the US regulator would likely classify as securities such as :\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003emAssets (mTSLA, mGOOGL, … thoses are synthetixs of shares)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSynths.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThere for me multiple issues with this:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThis applies to everyone, even outside of the US juridiction. (there might be some legal ground about that, maybe since Uniswap Labs is in the US they must apply thoses regulations even to non US “customers”)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe message is a missleading “unsupported token” instead of “This is not supported on this gateway, pls use an other gateway”.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo ok the uniswap labs team doesn’t want or can’t deal with the legal implications of this. Then let just find someone else who does.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/MicahZoltu/uniswap-frontend/releases/tag/v4.11.1-uncensored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://github.com/MicahZoltu/uniswap-frontend/releases/tag/v4.11.1-uncensored\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWell \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/micah\"\u003e@Micah\u003c/a\u003e is willing to do it. This is just a fork of the Uniswap Lab’s UI but with the list removed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTechnically, we just update the IPFS field of \u003ccode\u003euniswap.eth\u003c/code\u003e to \u003ccode\u003eipns://uniswap-UI-multisig.eth\u003c/code\u003e, instead of \u003ccode\u003eipns://app.uniswap.org\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThat would change the resolution of:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003euniswap.eth\u003c/code\u003e (for thoses who use IPFS)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://uniswap.eth.link\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003euniswap.eth.link\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe would also need to have a multisig checking releases, because for example if we just point it to \u003ccode\u003eipns://uniswap-uncensored.eth\u003c/code\u003e well that would work, but \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/micah\"\u003e@Micah\u003c/a\u003e would have full control over the code that is distributed, which isn’t very decentralised.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSadly \u003ccode\u003eapp.uniswap.org\u003c/code\u003e wouldn’t get updated as it’s \u003ccode\u003euniswap.eth\u003c/code\u003e redirecting to \u003ccode\u003eapp.uniswap.org\u003c/code\u003e not the reverse.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThat pretty much it.\u003cbr\u003e\nAs is this wouldn’t have much impact, because very few people uses \u003ccode\u003euniswap.eth\u003c/code\u003e, but it would be simple to advertise \u003ca href=\"https://uniswap.eth.link\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://uniswap.eth.link\u003c/a\u003e instead, it’s from the governance and should be as safe.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2021-07-24T18:57:15.352Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":574,"reads":53,"readers_count":52,"score":2970.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":13586,"topic_slug":"change-the-ipfs-resolution-of-uniswap-eth-from-app-uniswap-org-to-uniswap-uncensored-eth","display_username":"Jorropo","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://uniswap.eth.link","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":64},{"url":"https://github.com/MicahZoltu/uniswap-frontend/releases/tag/v4.11.1-uncensored","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Release Release v4.11.1-uncensored · MicahZoltu/uniswap-frontend · GitHub","clicks":42}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":6}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":8087,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/change-the-ipfs-resolution-of-uniswap-eth-from-app-uniswap-org-to-uniswap-uncensored-eth/13586/1","calendar_details":[],"reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":6}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":6,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":34444,"name":"","username":"Naught","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/ba8739/{size}.png","created_at":"2021-07-25T02:57:10.345Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHaving a multi-sig of names sounds a little risky for those individuals, if this is for a non-regulatory compliant version of a UI.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI think there could be an interesting application built that would create a unique fork for every user who is looking to use Uniswap protocol. i.e. everyone can launch their own IPFS attestation of uniswap UI (user A pushes button that launches a IPFS of latest UI that can be used and reused; bonus if the user can also customize the UI background logo etc to their own personalization). Just an idea.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2021-07-25T02:57:10.345Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":12,"reads":39,"readers_count":38,"score":82.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":13586,"topic_slug":"change-the-ipfs-resolution-of-uniswap-eth-from-app-uniswap-org-to-uniswap-uncensored-eth","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":5519,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/change-the-ipfs-resolution-of-uniswap-eth-from-app-uniswap-org-to-uniswap-uncensored-eth/13586/2","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":34466,"name":"Christoph Siegenthaler","username":"ChrisSiegenthaler","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/gov.uniswap.org/chrissiegenthaler/{size}/1965_2.png","created_at":"2021-07-26T11:13:04.782Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI like the idea. Even if it’s mostly symbolic I also welcome an official IPFS build with the country and token blocklists disabled. I host a frontend mirror on uniswap.ch (which I’ll need to update, last update from 13 days ago) where I remove the blocklists but as already written by \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/jorropo\"\u003e@Jorropo\u003c/a\u003e , having a multisig “verified” build on IPFS would be a lot more decentralized then having a single user host the build.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2021-07-26T11:13:04.782Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":5,"reads":33,"readers_count":32,"score":61.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":13586,"topic_slug":"change-the-ipfs-resolution-of-uniswap-eth-from-app-uniswap-org-to-uniswap-uncensored-eth","display_username":"Christoph Siegenthaler","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":6630,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/change-the-ipfs-resolution-of-uniswap-eth-from-app-uniswap-org-to-uniswap-uncensored-eth/13586/3","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":2}],"curre